---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Projects — GeoSmart" description="Selected geology projects by Camila Fernández, covering geophysics, sedimentology, GIS and subsurface thinking.">
  <section class="page-hero projects-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-kicker">Selected work</div>
      <h1>Projects</h1>
      <p class="muted">A growing portfolio of university work and geological problem-solving — from observations and maps to geophysical interpretation and subsurface thinking.</p>
      <div class="hero-rule" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section projects-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="projects-intro"><span class="projects-count">03</span><p>Areas of work · documents and figures coming as the portfolio grows</p></div>
      <div class="projects-grid">
        <article class="card project-card">
          <div class="card-image seismic-card"><span>01 / GEOPHYSICS</span><i>⌁</i></div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="card-tag">Geophysics · Seismic</div>
            <h3>Seismic Interpretation</h3>
            <p>Work focused on reading seismic evidence as geological information: recognising reflections and structures, building interpretations and thinking carefully about uncertainty.</p>
            <p class="muted"><strong>Coming next:</strong> selected coursework, interpretation figures and the final report.</p>
            <div class="project-line"><span>01</span><span>SUBSURFACE</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card project-card">
          <div class="card-image sediment-card"><span>02 / SEDIMENTOLOGY</span><i>≋</i></div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="card-tag">Sedimentology</div>
            <h3>Sedimentary Environments</h3>
            <p>Coursework connecting sedimentary structures, textures and observations with the environments in which sediments are deposited.</p>
            <p class="muted"><strong>Coming next:</strong> logs, reports, field observations and interpretation work.</p>
            <div class="project-line"><span>02</span><span>EARTH HISTORY</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card project-card">
          <div class="card-image gis-card"><span>03 / MAPPING</span><i>＋</i></div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="card-tag">GIS · Field Geology</div>
            <h3>Geological Mapping</h3>
            <p>Maps and spatial data used alongside geological reasoning — turning observations and information into a coherent picture of an area.</p>
            <p class="muted"><strong>Coming next:</strong> maps, figures and selected GIS-based coursework.</p>
            <div class="project-line"><span>03</span><span>SPATIAL THINKING</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-box project-cta">
        <div class="section-kicker">A growing portfolio</div>
        <h2>More work is on its way.</h2>
        <p>I'm adding the actual university projects behind these topics rather than filling the portfolio with generic examples. Each project will show the question, approach, tools, interpretation and what I learned from it.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="../contact/">Want to talk about a project? →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .projects-hero { position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
  .projects-hero::before { content:'01'; position:absolute; right:5%; top:12%; color:rgba(15,61,62,.055); font:700 clamp(8rem,20vw,18rem)/1 'Playfair Display',serif; letter-spacing:-.08em; }
  .hero-rule { display:flex; gap:7px; margin-top:34px; align-items:center; }
  .hero-rule span { display:block; height:3px; background:var(--orange); }
  .hero-rule span:nth-child(1){width:70px}.hero-rule span:nth-child(2){width:18px;opacity:.55}.hero-rule span:nth-child(3){width:7px;opacity:.3}
  .projects-intro { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:18px; margin:0 0 28px; color:#69706d; font-size:.72rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.1em; }
  .projects-count { color:var(--orange); font:600 2.4rem/1 'Playfair Display',serif; }
  .project-card { position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
  .project-card .card-image { transition:transform .45s ease; }
  .project-card:hover .card-image { transform:scale(1.025); }
  .project-card .card-image i { position:absolute; right:18px; top:14px; z-index:2; color:rgba(255,255,255,.55); font:italic 2rem 'Playfair Display',serif; }
  .project-line { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:22px; padding-top:12px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); color:#7a807d; font-size:.6rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.12em; }
  .project-line span:first-child { color:var(--orange); }
  .project-cta { position:relative; overflow:hidden; margin-top:64px; }
  .project-cta::after { content:'GEOSMART'; position:absolute; right:-15px; bottom:-28px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.035); font:700 5rem/1 'Montserrat',sans-serif; letter-spacing:.08em; pointer-events:none; }
  .project-cta p { max-width:720px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.78); }
  .project-cta .text-link { position:relative; z-index:1; }
  @media (max-width:800px){ .projects-hero::before{right:-3%;top:24%;font-size:8rem}.projects-intro{align-items:flex-start}.project-cta{margin-top:42px} }
</style>